      "description": "The text references 'terrorism' as an area where 'they' do most of the work but get no credit. This implicitly references the stereotype that Muslims are associated with terrorism, which is a common element of Islamophobia. Understanding this stereotype is necessary to interpret the meme's underlying message.",
