      "instance_name": "terrorism",
      "label": "Terrorism",
      "description": "The text explicitly mentions 'terrorism' as an area where 'they' do most of the work. This requires background knowledge about terrorism as a global security issue and the common association of terrorism with specific groups (e.g., Muslims). Understanding terrorism as a real-world concept is necessary to interpret the meme's message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
