      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals familiar with or interested in political satire, conspiracy theories, or critiques of power structures, particularly those who recognize the stereotype linking white men to terrorism and the irony in the meme's message. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who understand the historical and cultural context of Islamophobia and gender/racial stereotypes in security and political discourse, and who appreciate dark humor or ironic commentary on these topics.",
